Here it is, the battle's finally starting!{KP}
First, I'll explain the colors of
the areas and the background.

jp:
いきなり　カンで　せめこんでも　いいけど
ワナに　かかっちゃったりしたら　ヤだしね{KP}
じゃ　ていさつを　えらんでみて

en:
We could charge in on a hunch, but
getting caught in a trap would stink.{KP}
So, choose Scout.

jp:
えらぶのは　ていさつだってば！{KP}
